ors than usual!","nextNodeIds":[401930302]},{"nodeId":401930302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3038,"speakerName":"Aikawa Susumu","textMapHash":686673898,"text":"Based on what we've made so far, I think we'll be able to make... this much!","nextNodeIds":[401930303]},{"nodeId":401930303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1097,"speakerName":"Yumemizuki Mizuki","textMapHash":1970593290,"text":"That's great news! We might even beat Yae Publishing house this month...","nextNodeIds":[401930304]},{"nodeId":401930304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":500777018,"text":"Oh? You look pleased about something... Having a party without me?","nextNodeIds":[401930305]},{"nodeId":401930305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1097,"speakerName":"Yumemizuki Mizuki","textMapHash":300785650,"text":"Oh, hehe... It's nothing...","nextNodeIds":[401930306]},{"nodeId":401930306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":1938847906,"text":"I forgot to share some good news with you...","nextNodeIds":[401930307]},{"nodeId":401930307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"Yae Miko","textMapHash":659609858,"text":"Thirty percent of the proceeds from the festival have been transferred to Yae Publishing House. We're expecting record profit this month... Don't you think congratulations are in order?","nextNodeIds":[401930308]},{"nodeId":401930308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1097,"speakerName":"Yumemizuki Mizuki","textMapHash":435775202,"text":"What!?","nextNodeIds":[401930309]},{"nodeId":401930309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3038,"speakerName":"Aikawa Susumu","textMapHash":508957834,"text":"W—Well, boss... I guess congratulations ARE in order... This is our 333rd time competing against Yae Publishing House in sales, and our best showing to date — second place!","nextNodeIds":[401930310]},{"nodeId":401930310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"spea